  "id": "tax.us.2025.rule.schedule-a-line16",
  "notes": "Schedule A line 16 for the bounded class: gambling losses, limited to the gambling winnings reported on Schedule 1 line 8b (min of the gambling losses subtotal and the Form W-2G box 1 winnings subtotal; 100 percent of losses for 2025). The minimum is a comparison inside choose, not a new operation. With no Form W-2G recorded the winnings are zero, so the line is zero and the losses family is not read (a losses entry with no winnings counts as zero, never a refusal). With a Form W-2G recorded the losses family must be confirmed closed: an unconfirmed family is SOURCE_SET_UNCLOSED, an unresolved result and not a zero. Wagering expenses and a professional gambler's business are outside the class. The part of the losses that does not count is the losses subtotal minus this line.",
